# --token sesame: operator commands, a kick, and a shutdown with clients connected.
# bob reads the message before the kick: a kick ends a connection at once,
# and may drop what was queued for it but not yet written.
alice: NICK alice
bob: NICK bob
alice: JOIN #ops
bob: JOIN #ops
bob: KICK alice
alice: OPER open-sesame
alice: OPER sesame
alice: MOTD Mind the gap.
bob: MOTD
alice: TOPIC #ops staff only
bob: WHO #ops
alice: MSG #ops this goes to the history file
bob: !read
alice: KICK nobody
alice: KICK bob
bob: !eof
alice: WHO #ops
carol: NICK carol
alice: SHUTDOWN sesame
carol: !eof
alice: !eof